        "text": "Hello, and welcome to Safe Online! My name is Ryan, and this is my channel about cybersecurity. I make short tutorials for beginners. I really enjoy teaching, and I love helping people. Many people do not like reading long manuals. They prefer watching a short video. So every Monday, I upload a new episode. This week, the playlist is about passwords. In episode one, you learn how to create a strong password. If you enjoy this video, please subscribe to the channel. See you next Monday!"
